@startuml
skinparam conditionStyle diamond
skinparam ConditionEndStyle diamond
skinparam ActivityDiamondFontSize 11
skinparam swimlaneWidth 220
|Purchasing Employee|
start
:Open minimum stock overview;
|System|
:Retrieve physical warehouse stock per product;
:Compare with each product minimum stock;
if (Any products below minimum?) then ([yes])
  :Show shortages and required quantities;
  |Purchasing Employee|
  :Select shortage to follow up;
  |System|
  :Show linked manufacturers sorted by purchase price;
  if (Manufacturer offers available?) then ([yes])
    |Purchasing Employee|
    :Contact cheapest available manufacturer by phone or website;
    if (Manufacturer can supply?) then ([yes])
      :Agree desired purchase quantity;
      |System|
      :Register manually agreed purchase order (AD02);
    else ([no])
      |Purchasing Employee|
      :Contact next cheapest available manufacturer (AD02);
    endif
  else ([no])
    :Show no available linked manufacturer;
    |Purchasing Employee|
    :Assess shortage with purchasing team;
  endif
else ([no])
  :Show that all stock levels meet minimums;
endif
stop
@enduml
